  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Idle Transfiguration — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>Starting at 11th level, you can use <em>Self-Alteration</em> as a free action on your turn. As an action for 5 Cursed Energy you can spend 2 or more Transfigured Creatures, fusing together for one of the following:<br />\n<strong>Body Repel.</strong> You create a barrage of Transfigured creatures being launched at high speeds. You make a ranged Cursed Energy attack with a range of 60/120 feet that deals 4d8 necrotic damage on a hit. For every additional Transfigured Creature, you deal another 1d8 necrotic damage and can split the damage die between different targets to make multiple attacks.<br />\n<strong>Polymorphic Soul Isomer.</strong> You create a Polymorphic Soul Isomer for 1 minute. When using this technique, you can add another Transfigured Creature to the fusion. Each transfigured creature counts as one soul.  </p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
